[31m-[m
[31m-**gsap.matchMedia()** (GSAP 3.11+) runs setup code only when a media query matches; when it stops matching, all animations and ScrollTriggers created in that run are **reverted automatically**. Use it for responsive breakpoints (e.g. desktop vs mobile) and for **prefers-reduced-motion** so users who prefer reduced motion get minimal or no animation.[m
