[31m-[m
[31m-Respecting **prefers-reduced-motion** is important for users with vestibular disorders. Use `duration: 0` or skip the animation when `reduceMotion` is true. Do not nest **gsap.context()** inside matchMedia — matchMedia creates a context internally; use **mm.revert()** only.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Full docs: [gsap.matchMedia()](https://gsap.com/docs/v3/GSAP/gsap.matchMedia/). For immediate re-run of all matching handlers (e.g. after toggling a reduced-motion control), use **gsap.matchMediaRefresh()**.[m
