[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m## Prefer the useGSAP() Hook[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32mWhen **@gsap/react** is available, use the **useGSAP()** hook instead of `useEffect()` for GSAP setup. It handles cleanup automatically and provides a scope and **contextSafe** for callbacks.[m[41m[m
