[32m+[m[32m## Server-Side Rendering (Next.js, etc.)[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32mGSAP runs in the browser. Do not call gsap or ScrollTrigger during SSR.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Use **useGSAP** (or useEffect) so all GSAP code runs only on the client.[m[41m[m
