[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m## Best practices[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- ✅ Prefer **useGSAP()** from `@gsap/react` rather than `useEffect()`/`useLayoutEffect()`; use **gsap.context()** + **ctx.revert()** in `useEffect` when `useGSAP` is not an option.[m[41m[m
