[32m+[m[32m- ✅ Run GSAP only on the client (useGSAP or useEffect); do not call gsap or ScrollTrigger during SSR.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m## Do Not[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- ❌ Target by **selector without a scope**; always pass **scope** (ref or element) in useGSAP or gsap.context() so selectors like `.box` are limited to that root and do not match elements outside the component.[m[41m[m
