[31m-## Registering the Plugin[m
[31m-[m
[31m-ScrollTrigger is a plugin. After loading the script, register it once:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```javascript[m
[31m-gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);[m
[31m-```[m
