[32m+[m[32m- Supports ownership/share distribution flows.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Handles legacy and branch-specific wallet cases inside live data processing.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m### 4) Loan Lifecycle Integration[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Dedicated loans tab (`LoansTab`) inside wallet operations.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Loan-linked transfers and repayment/borrow metadata are represented in transactions.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Keeps borrowing behavior visible and auditable in treasury context.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m### 5) Security and Role Control[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Role-based wallet access checks.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Optional PIN protection for sensitive finance views.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Realtime Firestore streams for wallets and transactions reduce stale finance states.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m## Business Value[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Tighter cash governance** with explicit transaction flows and wallet boundaries.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Better branch financial control** through branch-aware wallet structures.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Higher auditability** by preserving transaction context and loan metadata.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Faster treasury operations** with bulk selection and integrated transfer tooling.[m[41m[m
